   "body": "Related CI hardening (found by Fable on #867, 2026-11-13): the **Sync labels** workflow (`.github/workflows/labels.yml`) loops over `labels.yml` under `bash -e`. One label rejected by GitHub (HTTP 422, for example a description over 100 characters) stops the loop, so every later label is never synced; it failed this way 4 times since 2026-11-09. `scripts/configure-repo.sh:41` uses the same loop. Fix with the other CI work here:\n- a length check on `labels.yml` in CI;\n- or a loop that continues and fails at the end with the list of rejected labels.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
